(text "FPGA configuration, JTAG, ADC, clock" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 15.748 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "696bc891-5fb2-5d87-9fc4-6f092e493e90"))
(text "VCCIOCFG: 47u, 470n, 100n" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 132.08 18.415 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "648d665f-c010-54a7-bb1c-966f1d6ed263"))
(text "5 V monitor: 0.45 V at VAADC" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 132.08 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d9c702b7-25ab-54b5-a7d4-88d6548ebce4"))
(text "MODE[2:0] = 001: master SPI.\nFit JP1 for 101: JTAG only." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 162.56 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "57658757-6c63-52f8-82b7-ea01fa7beb8f"))
(text "JTAG: not fitted in production" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 130.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "54d52bbc-cf1c-5d0f-8b6c-6ee717408ce3"))
(text "HSST quad QR3: not used (UG040012 Table 5-1)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 142.748 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c82e3470-de2f-554b-b4cb-976a65aedab2"))
(text "Supplies left floating, with a DNP\ngrounding resistor each. RX and RREF\ngrounded. TX and REFCLK open." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 106.68 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e0c5e4c9-f04d-5eaa-a856-28dfd6abd090"))
(text "QSPI NOR flash: bitstreams, loader, application (untrusted storage)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 201.93 15.748 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ca7980d5-c5ff-5512-9f4d-cf6ff1cdda36"))
(text "FLASH_CLK_USR: optional fabric-driven clock (DNP link)\nif the CFG_CLK user-mode primitive is not used.\nIO_STATUS_C high: user I/O are high-Z during configuration." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 205.74 89.535 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "81883d79-79c1-59d3-a305-090939923f24"))
(text "Secure element (always-on rail, I2C stays inside the enclosure)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 201.93 99.568 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9e96fa54-91c5-5dab-822f-74c2f1ca317f"))
(text "Nothing else on this bus." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 261.62 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8b73d4fa-cd89-5954-9d62-73401bf2deb4"))
(text "Real-time clock: wake alarm, local time (untrusted)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 201.93 150.368 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "024cdf4b-eb68-5921-b3f9-dbaa33404266"))
(text "2 x SR44 in series (3.1 V), primary cells:\nkeep the RTC charge function off (CHGEN = 0).\n/INT is open drain and latches until cleared.\nFOUT and /RST are not used." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 243.84 205.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7c6d15d1-a68c-5f86-bd57-fce74d7d7a54"))
(text "Isolation between the FPGA (switched 3V3) and the always-on domain" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 311.15 15.748 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8697cae6-c864-51aa-a240-50dbfc5f42a6"))
(text "Gate at +3V3: with the FPGA rail off each FET is off and its body\ndiode is reverse biased, so the always-on side stays high and\nnothing back-feeds the unpowered FPGA." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 312.42 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f22200eb-72af-5828-a849-99b77099eba0"))
(text "Notes\n1. Root of trust = FPGA (eFuse key, authenticated bitstream) + QSPI flash + ATECC608C.\n2. Master SPI x4 at 3.3 V: VCCIOCFG = VCCIOL5 = 3.3 V, SCBV tied to VCCIOCFG (UG040012 Table 2-1).\n   Flash data and chip select are on bank L5 (User Banks L page); the clock is CFG_CLK.\n3. VCCB (battery-backed key RAM) is not used: tied to VCCA through R0 (Table 9-2). Keys are in eFuse.\n4. ADC: internal reference (VREFADC to ground). TSDP/TSDN grounded (unused); check UG040009.\n5. W25Q256JV-IQ ships with QE = 1; 4-byte address read opcodes are needed above 16 MB.\n6. The secure element and the RTC each have their own I2C bus. Pull-ups to 3V3_AO on their side,\n   to +3V3 on the FPGA side. RTC_INT_N and PB_N tell the boot ROM the boot cause.\n7. YSN8130E footprint: 3.2 x 2.5 mm, 10 pads, same pinout as Epson RX8130CE." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 147.32 281.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7b9d49d3-8423-5e63-9a2c-2bc94fec93b4"))
